   - FeatureProvider

2. Added Suspense wrapper to handle any lazy loading

3. Added mock data for session and i18n instance to prevent undefined errors

4. Imported all required dependencies

5. Added error handling with Suspense fallback

The component should now render properly with all the required context providers. The providers are wrapped in the same order as shown in the component stack trace, which should resolve the module fetching error.

